{"seconds": 30.3, "exit": 0, "final": "After Rxf8 Rg8+ Qxg8, material is roughly equal again. The cleaner win is the main line with mate in 3. \n\n**Best move: Qxh6+**\n\n**Main line:** \n- Qxh6+ Qh7 \n- Qxf8+ Qg8 (if Rxf8 Rg8+ and White is winning, but Qg8 loses faster)\n- Rxg8+ Kh7 \n- Qg7#\n\n---\n\n**Coaching Note:**\nLook for back-rank mating nets when the opponent's king is boxed in. Here, the Black king on h8 has no escape squares. By forcing Qh7 with check, you set up Qxf8 (removing the rook that defends the 8th rank), then Rxg8 forces the king to h7, where Qg7 is checkmate. The key: recognize when the king lacks flight squares\u2014that's where mating attacks live.\n\n```json\n{\"move\": \"Qxh6+\", \"line\": [\"Qxh6+\", \"Qh7\", \"Qxf8+\", \"Qg8\", \"Rxg8+\", \"Kh7\", \"Qg7\"], \"motifs\": [\"fork\", \"backRankMate\"]}\n```", "tool_calls": [{"tool": "skill", "args": {"skill": "chess-coach"}}, {"tool": "chess-eyes-board", "args": {"fen": "4rr1k/1b1p4/5p1p/1P3q2/P7/6R1/3Q2PP/4R2K w - - 6 45"}}, {"tool": "chess-eyes-threats", "args": {"fen": "4rr1k/1b1p4/5p1p/1P3q2/P7/6R1/3Q2PP/4R2K w - - 6 45"}}, {"tool": "chess-eyes-legal_moves", "args": {"fen": "4rr1k/1b1p4/5p1p/1P3q2/P7/6R1/3Q2PP/4R2K w - - 6 45"}}, {"tool": "chess-eyes-inspect_move", "args": {"fen": "4rr1k/1b1p4/5p1p/1P3q2/P7/6R1/3Q2PP/4R2K w - - 6 45", "move": "Rg8+"}}, {"tool": "chess-eyes-inspect_move", "args": {"fen": "4rr1k/1b1p4/5p1p/1P3q2/P7/6R1/3Q2PP/4R2K w - - 6 45", "move": "Qxh6+"}}, {"tool": "chess-eyes-inspect_move", "args": {"fen": "4rr1k/1b1p4/5p1Q/1P3q2/P7/6R1/6PP/4R2K b - - 0 45", "move": "Qh7"}}, {"tool": "chess-eyes-inspect_move", "args": {"fen": "4rr1k/1b1p3q/5p1Q/1P6/P7/6R1/6PP/4R2K w - - 1 46", "move": "Qxf8+"}}, {"tool": "chess-eyes-inspect_move", "args": {"fen": "4rQ1k/1b1p3q/5p2/1P6/P7/6R1/6PP/4R2K b - - 0 46", "move": "Rxf8"}}, {"tool": "chess-eyes-inspect_move", "args": {"fen": "4rQ1k/1b1p3q/5p2/1P6/P7/6R1/6PP/4R2K b - - 0 46", "move": "Qg8"}}, {"tool": "chess-eyes-inspect_move"